7b7d14acfedc251f3d2e25e9aec4e21e361e1ea7f255f218c2e539c604757e078493614662ba92dfebb62f67be85a71fcba374f941338dc964e0dc858022712b  0001-ar_osal-build-with-musl-spell-out-the-unused-attribute.patch
